# 52. PACKET PARSING

The basic parsing process is:

```text
Raw Bytes
   ↓
Ethernet
   ↓
Check EtherType
   ↓
IPv4?
   ↓
Read IP Header
   ↓
Check Protocol
   ↓
TCP / UDP / ICMP
   ↓
Extract fields
```

This is the key concept behind today's topic.

---

# 53. SIMPLE CUSTOM PARSER LOGIC

```text
if EtherType == IPv4:
    parse IPv4

    if Protocol == TCP:
        parse TCP

    elif Protocol == UDP:
        parse UDP

    elif Protocol == ICMP:
        parse ICMP
```

