# 78. EXAM TRAPS

### Trap 1

**Scapy and Wireshark are identical.**

❌ No.

Scapy is highly programmable; Wireshark is primarily an interactive protocol analyzer.

---

### Trap 2

**A packet sniffer automatically sees all network traffic.**

❌ No.

What an interface can capture depends on network architecture, switching, interface configuration, capture point, and permissions.

---

### Trap 3

**Port 443 proves HTTPS.**

❌ No.

Port numbers are commonly associated with services but are not proof of application protocol.

---

### Trap 4

**SYN means an attack.**

❌ No.

SYN is normal TCP behavior.

---

### Trap 5

**A sniffer can automatically read HTTPS passwords.**

❌ No.

TLS protects application data.

